{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink","id":669810,"title":"How can a Solar glow pink ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-18T10:20:29-07:00","id":669810,"title":"How can a Solar glow pink ?","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ZZFNbId.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> If I ever get over my fear of playing a combat monkey then I definitely will play a Solar sword mistress, run-away grandmaster of the Jeweled Lotus sect. Kind of a huge fashionista who favor various shade of pink. But the problem is Solar glows like a molten gold which clashes just a tiny bit with the cloth's color, plus, a lotus anima looks way way way better in pink IMO. So if someone at your table say that the character's personality and symbolism is so strong that it recolors their anima banner, do you the shit out of them with your book ?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:24:57-07:00","id":669838,"title":"","content":"Pink is a common color in sunrises, so you can play a Dawn with a Sunrise Anima.<br /> <br /> Anima is a cosmetic character feature, so if I were an ST, I'd be willing to bend the rules a bit for a PC. Though, I wouldn't let the PC with an uncommon anima banner try to pull off passing as a different type of Exalt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:26:09-07:00","id":669841,"title":"","content":"You really just need to evoke a Sun Aesthetic with the colors of your anima. Mix in a few other colors and you could easily got the colors of a spectacular Sunrise or Sunset with lots of Pinks.<br /> <br /> You anima does have to communicate what kind of Exalt you are, but it also communicates a lot about your character too, and that provides a lot of flexibility.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c2.staticflickr.com/4/3057/2775576993_32fa62d399.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":151,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","user":"Hark","date":". 09-18-2015, 01:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:29:34-07:00","id":669845,"title":"","content":"Well, considering that various castes can have some color variation in their animas (it's right on the Caste description page) I might allow it, depending on the shade of pink and how cannon locked a game I was doing. The soft, powerdy pink you have in the picture might be a bit of a stretch for my table, and I might try to talk you into something more purple-ish (or that orange-y peach color in the lower left corner), but I'm generally a softie when it comes to aesthetics. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a Woman, I'm a GM. <i>Of course</i> I'm Evil.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/424-dawaterrat","name":"DaWaterRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:29:44-07:00","id":669846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669838#post669838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pink is a common color in sunrises, so you can play a Dawn with a Sunrise Anima.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's is ?<br /> <br /> :search google for pink sunrise&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh my, are these real or photoshop. I can do with a lighter shade of pink though, but this should work enough <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/glJjCzj.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 09-18-2015, 01:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:33:05-07:00","id":669848,"title":"","content":"As it turns out, even solar are not completely &quot;blank slate for any sort of skilled hero&quot;. The Sun themes can interfere with concepts sporadically.<br /> <br /> In this particular case, however...maybe you can make her Twilight? Not quite pink, usually, but some bright purples and subtle light reds might result in Anima that fits well with pink clothing. Heck, Dawn can probably do some rose colors, perhaps alongside a gold, red or orange here and there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:44:52-07:00","id":669857,"title":"","content":"Dawn can be pink as fuck, just roll with it.<br /> I was born and raised in a pretty mountainy area, that above picture is probably not photoshopped, and if it is, it didn't need to be, because that's not an unusual sunrise at high altitude.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:52:03-07:00","id":669873,"title":"","content":"Here, what the corebook has to say for us on solar animas color palettes...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Dawn Caste Solars</i>' animas tend to be bright white and <b>pale gold</b>, sometimes <b>tinged </b>with <b>red </b>or <b>light violet</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>Zenith Caste Solars</i>' animas are a <b>brilliant</b>, <b>burning white</b> or <b>a majestic gold</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>Twilight Caste Solars</i>' animas tend to the most spectacular colors, containing <b>bright golds</b> as well as <b>bright </b>and <b>dark reds</b>, <b>purples </b>and <b>even blues</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>Night Caste Solars</i>' animas are <b>ghostly whites</b> and <b>golds</b>, <b>tinged </b>with <b>purple </b>and <b>purple-gray</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>Eclipse Caste Solars</i>' animas are <b>brilliant whites</b> and <b>golds</b>, almost sparkling, but <b>filmy </b>and <b>fluctuating</b>, like the corona of the sun during an eclipse. </div> </div> </div>No pink or rose outright mentioned, but between reds, purples, golds and blues, there might be some wiggle room to be found, i think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:59:01-07:00","id":669879,"title":"","content":"Important thing is anima banner identifies patron as well as Exalt. If anima so pink it confuses viewers, then is inappropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:03:07-07:00","id":669902,"title":"","content":"Or recognize that since anima color has literally zero mechanical effect, players should feel free customize it as much as they want (within reason, I mean, a solar is not going to have a black and green anima, but a zenith whose anima is a bright white-gold rose tinged in reds, or a giant golden cactus with filmy white blossoms reminiscent of heat haze isn't hurting anything). <br /> <br /> Another example, I have a Dawn whose anima is a pale gold double-headed eagle with rosy-tipped talons and beaks (as in, looks flecked with blood) and burning blue-violet eyes, with blue-violent along the trailing edges of its wing pinions as well. <br /> <br /> Go nuts and if someone gives you shit for it, hit *them* with the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:31:49-07:00","id":669922,"title":"","content":"I just want to say I agree with everyone. Unless your anima banner is bright flaming red to the point where dragonblooded exalts can't tell the difference between it and a fire aspect anima, or some other such thing, go nuts. In fact twilight saga could even have green animas, owing to that little flash of green light that's often seen just as the sun sets.<br /> <br /> Edit: apparently the green flash can happen at dawn too, so dawns go nuts with green.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:33:23-07:00","id":669924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669922#post669922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In fact twilight saga could even have green animas, owing to that little flash of green light that's often seen just as the sun sets.<br /> <br /> Edit: apparently the green flash can happen at dawn too, so dawns go nuts with green.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ligier approves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:33:58-07:00","id":669925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669879#post669879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Important thing is anima banner identifies patron as well as Exalt. If anima so pink it confuses viewers, then is inappropriate.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If blue isn't too confusing, why would pink be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2219-delta","name":"Delta","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T11:48:58-07:00","id":669945,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest sticking with Dawn or Twilight, and also including some gold, yellow, red, or orange in the anima.<br /> <br /> I do not think green is appropriate for a Solar, though. That association is just too Infernal.<br /> (Likewise, I don't consider brown or black appropriate).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T12:12:03-07:00","id":669978,"title":"","content":"From the general tenor of the thread, not that another bit of support was really needed, but hey:<br /> <br /> The epithet &quot;rosy-fingered Dawn&quot; appears no small number of times in the Odyssey. If it's good enough for Homer, it's probably good enough for your Solar's anima banner. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T12:26:40-07:00","id":670001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669879#post669879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Important thing is anima banner identifies patron as well as Exalt. If anima so pink it confuses viewers, then is inappropriate.</div> </div> </div> </div>IMO the Caste mark is much more important than the anima.<br /> <br /> The anima reflects the Exalt's soul and personality. The Caste mark shows the true nature of their blessing. A Dawn with a greenish-white anima is still going to have a Dawn Caste mark, with all the immaculate baggage that carries; likewise with a Twilight with a dark red-gold anima.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669945#post669945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd suggest sticking with Dawn or Twilight</div> </div> </div> </div>See above.<br /> <br /> Would y'all really police this? <i>Really?</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T12:27:29-07:00","id":670003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669945#post669945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'d suggest sticking with Dawn or Twilight, and also including some gold, yellow, red, or orange in the anima.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not like, super baleful green fire all the time or anything like that, but if you wanted to have a golden tree topped with glittering green leaves, why not?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/669810-how-can-a-solar-glow-pink?p=669945#post669945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <di